## 12. Responsive behavior

\*\*Desktop:\*\* existing sidebar with the full adaptive Dashboard grid.

\*\*Tablet:\*\* collapsed sidebar and reflowed cards.

\*\*Mobile:\*\* navigation drawer and single-column content, with the four metric cards arranged in a 2-column grid.

Charts must fit the viewport. Reflow container rows without horizontal scrolling. Preserve readable labels, values and comfortable touch targets.

